(5631856, 817431, 99981, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice and it really meets the challenge. I just think it''s a little oof and it could be brighter in my opinion.</td>', 'The colors are nice and it really meets the challenge. I just think it''s a little oof and it could be brighter in my opinion.', '2009-09-02 01:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
