(5631860, 817749, 99710, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2009-09-02 01:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631864, 817505, 99981, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, it really gave a nice "mood" to this shot, the position of the shadow and the insect is great, so as the light and colors. The just think the insect is the prime object there, not lines.</td>', 'I really like the composition, it really gave a nice "mood" to this shot, the position of the shadow and the insect is great, so as the light and colors. The just think the insect is the prime object there, not lines.', '2009-09-02 01:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631874, 818618, 99981, '<td valign="top">The colors of the sky are nice and you did a good job with the silhouette. I just think you could try this shot from another perspective, because i''m not sure where to look with so many lines and other stuff, the dark part at the bottom could be croped in my opinion too. Good luck, sorry if i was rude.</td>', 'The colors of the sky are nice and you did a good job with the silhouette. I just think you could try this shot from another perspective, because i''m not sure where to look with so many lines and other stuff, the dark part at the bottom could be croped in my opinion too. Good luck, sorry if i was rude.', '2009-09-02 01:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631878, 817392, 99710, '<td valign="top">you can rotate the photo a bit during cropping and this would be so perfect</td>', 'you can rotate the photo a bit during cropping and this would be so perfect', '2009-09-02 01:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631879, 818230, 99710, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2009-09-02 01:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631880, 818617, 99710, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2009-09-02 01:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631882, 818739, 99981, '<td valign="top">i like the perspective and the colors, the blurry part is nice for me but i think it could be less than that. The big problem for me is that the first thing i think when i see this shot is not lines, but other things. Good shot though. Good luck to you!</td>', 'i like the perspective and the colors, the blurry part is nice for me but i think it could be less than that. The big problem for me is that the first thing i think when i see this shot is not lines, but other things. Good shot though. Good luck to you!', '2009-09-02 01:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631884, 818610, 99710, '<td valign="top">another simple yet wow photo</td>', 'another simple yet wow photo', '2009-09-02 01:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631888, 818323, 99981, '<td valign="top">You caught a strong moment there, the mix of yellow/orange/red is beautiful, i just think the shot is oof and DNMC, as i don''t see the lines very cleary here.<br/>Sorry if i was rude, good luck to you.</td>', 'You caught a strong moment there, the mix of yellow/orange/red is beautiful, i just think the shot is oof and DNMC, as i don''t see the lines very cleary here.Sorry if i was rude, good luck to you.', '2009-09-02 01:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631901, 818733, 99981, '<td valign="top">The reflections at the bottom are nice for me but they turned into a really distracting point from the prime object, which are the strings as lines. The light doesn''t help the beauty of the guitar too and it gave some harsh points at it and a harsh shadow too, the background and the place where the object is sitting are not very interesting too. <br/>I think a close-up at the strings with a different perspective, a black background and a good light this would be a nice shot! Just more tweaking in my opinion. <br/>I hope you don''t take this bad, it''s just my point of view. Good luck to you!</td>', 'The reflections at the bottom are nice for me but they turned into a really distracting point from the prime object, which are the strings as lines. The light doesn''t help the beauty of the guitar too and it gave some harsh points at it and a harsh shadow too, the background and the place where the object is sitting are not very interesting too. I think a close-up at the strings with a different perspective, a black background and a good light this would be a nice shot! Just more tweaking in my opinion. I hope you don''t take this bad, it''s just my point of view. Good luck to you!', '2009-09-02 01:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631922, 818764, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great textures, color, light and silhouette. The midle is a little distracting with this blurry but this shot is really great!</td>', 'Great textures, color, light and silhouette. The midle is a little distracting with this blurry but this shot is really great!', '2009-09-02 01:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5631927, 818297, 99981, '<td valign="top">The colors could be more saturated and the white reflection at the top and bottom are kind of distracting in my opinion, but this is a nice abstract with this perspective.</td>', 'The colors could be more saturated and the white reflection at the top and bottom are kind of distracting in my opinion, but this is a nice abstract with this perspective.', '2009-09-02 02:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
