(5631934, 818815, 99981, '<td valign="top">Oh no! I wanna take that right part of the building and destroy it. This is a great shot, the crop is nice and the colors at the sky too. Nice abstract perspective. The only problem is this right distracting top, no much of a problem!</td>', 'Oh no! I wanna take that right part of the building and destroy it. This is a great shot, the crop is nice and the colors at the sky too. Nice abstract perspective. The only problem is this right distracting top, no much of a problem!', '2009-09-02 02:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
