(5635199, 818515, 106148, '<td valign="top">I would love to draw this picture....so animated the kind you see in anime.<br/>Ok, so I have to "FOCUS". So The only thing the bugs me is 1. The over exposure 2. The limit of "FOCUS" and 3. The fact that this in in color and here''s why; the subject eyes are AWESOME!! I mean there''s so much going on in them, the reflections make them agrier. <br/> <br/>So suggestions....black and white so that the eyes would stand out and add contrast to the "Angry Lines". Oh, and possibly crop in further to the anger. otherwise nice capture.</td>', 'I would love to draw this picture....so animated the kind you see in anime.Ok, so I have to "FOCUS". So The only thing the bugs me is 1. The over exposure 2. The limit of "FOCUS" and 3. The fact that this in in color and here''s why; the subject eyes are AWESOME!! I mean there''s so much going on in them, the reflections make them agrier.  So suggestions....black and white so that the eyes would stand out and add contrast to the "Angry Lines". Oh, and possibly crop in further to the anger. otherwise nice capture.', '2009-09-04 00:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
