(5636304, 818190, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot along with the title just blew me away! You can definitely see the lines of time as the earth spins on it''s axis. Amazing! It took me back to the times when I use to hang out my bedroom window having a smoke at night and I would glimpse up to the stars and my heart would go thump as I pondered the universe and the one who created it... that greatest of all questions was on my mind, How could a God so huge know someone as insignificant as me? Does he still play a part in a person''s daily life or has he created this world upon which we live and left it to it''s own devices?</td>', 'This shot along with the title just blew me away! You can definitely see the lines of time as the earth spins on it''s axis. Amazing! It took me back to the times when I use to hang out my bedroom window having a smoke at night and I would glimpse up to the stars and my heart would go thump as I pondered the universe and the one who created it... that greatest of all questions was on my mind, How could a God so huge know someone as insignificant as me? Does he still play a part in a person''s daily life or has he created this world upon which we live and left it to it''s own devices?', '2009-09-04 22:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
