(5637055, 818024, 83313, '<td valign="top">I generally like this, but it seems a bit dim to me, but it has so much detail that ought to be jumping off the screen at me. I popped it into PaintShop Pro to have a looksie and found the histogram is flat on the light end for almost 1/4 of the image. A quick levels adjustment is all it needed to expand the dynamic range and really bring out some great detail and texture. It also brought my attention the the great expression on the girl''s face.</td>', 'I generally like this, but it seems a bit dim to me, but it has so much detail that ought to be jumping off the screen at me. I popped it into PaintShop Pro to have a looksie and found the histogram is flat on the light end for almost 1/4 of the image. A quick levels adjustment is all it needed to expand the dynamic range and really bring out some great detail and texture. It also brought my attention the the great expression on the girl''s face.', '2009-09-05 15:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
