(5637278, 818499, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting setup that fits the challenge well. Seems a bit flat looking though. I copied it into PaintShop Pro to see, and found some levels, curves, modest noise reduction and contrast really gave this some nice impact. As it stands, however, I have to give it a 5.</td>', 'An interesting setup that fits the challenge well. Seems a bit flat looking though. I copied it into PaintShop Pro to see, and found some levels, curves, modest noise reduction and contrast really gave this some nice impact. As it stands, however, I have to give it a 5.', '2009-09-05 19:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5637280, 817091, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract. What is it?</td>', 'Cool abstract. What is it?', '2009-09-05 19:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5637284, 817286, 83313, '<td valign="top">How do we know you are wise? Could just be normal wear and tear. Extra pointage just because I like Kilroy shots.</td>', 'How do we know you are wise? Could just be normal wear and tear. Extra pointage just because I like Kilroy shots.', '2009-09-05 19:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5637300, 818775, 83313, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of subject. Harsh midday sun is a problem here, though. It cCauses shadow that are too dark and overly bright highlights. I have found once in a while I can get a good shot in such light, but usually I have to concentrate on a detail view.</td>', 'Excellent choice of subject. Harsh midday sun is a problem here, though. It cCauses shadow that are too dark and overly bright highlights. I have found once in a while I can get a good shot in such light, but usually I have to concentrate on a detail view.', '2009-09-05 19:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5637303, 817608, 83313, '<td valign="top">You really should find a better place to store your models when you are not using them.</td>', 'You really should find a better place to store your models when you are not using them.', '2009-09-05 19:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5637306, 817636, 83313, '<td valign="top">One of the better power tower shots I have seen.</td>', 'One of the better power tower shots I have seen.', '2009-09-05 19:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5637315, 817839, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the treatment. Strikes me as very "Melethish". Can I use that as an adjective?</td>', 'I like the treatment. Strikes me as very "Melethish". Can I use that as an adjective?', '2009-09-05 19:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5637318, 817727, 47483, '<td valign="top">there is good chances it will ribbon. :-D</td>', 'there is good chances it will ribbon. :-D', '2009-09-05 19:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5637336, 817846, 83313, '<td valign="top">This got a 6 from me. Nice and sharp with good details and an interesting play of light. Composition is pretty standard rule of thirds and it works for this. Probably not enough wow factor for this to score very high with others, I think. Falls into the category of "good but not great".</td>', 'This got a 6 from me. Nice and sharp with good details and an interesting play of light. Composition is pretty standard rule of thirds and it works for this. Probably not enough wow factor for this to score very high with others, I think. Falls into the category of "good but not great".', '2009-09-05 20:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5637386, 817490, 37845, '<td valign="top">So, you gonna make it 4 top tens in a row with this one?  :)  Good luck.</td>', 'So, you gonna make it 4 top tens in a row with this one?  :)  Good luck.', '2009-09-05 20:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
