(5639341, 818412, 109995, '<td valign="top">very sleak</td>', 'very sleak', '2009-09-07 18:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639905, 817585, 99346, '<td valign="top">I really like the sharpness and clarity in this shot. The way it''s framed leaving out the hair and even the rest of the hand is nice too - forces the viewer to focus on the features. This shot deserves to do well.</td>', 'I really like the sharpness and clarity in this shot. The way it''s framed leaving out the hair and even the rest of the hand is nice too - forces the viewer to focus on the features. This shot deserves to do well.', '2009-09-08 01:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639920, 818045, 99346, '<td valign="top">I like this interpretation. For me the first thought in my mind when I saw the topic "Lines" was "Straight Lines", and looking at the bulk of the entries it seems I wasn''t the only one. This is a nice shot and the harsh contrast between the land and clouds definitely makes for a striking line.</td>', 'I like this interpretation. For me the first thought in my mind when I saw the topic "Lines" was "Straight Lines", and looking at the bulk of the entries it seems I wasn''t the only one. This is a nice shot and the harsh contrast between the land and clouds definitely makes for a striking line.', '2009-09-08 01:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639925, 818003, 99346, '<td valign="top">The desaturation on this shot was a great idea. And the contrast of the straight lines of the fance with the curved lines of the hat(?) and trees in the background is a nice touch. It never said anywhere in the challenge that the lines had to be straight ones!</td>', 'The desaturation on this shot was a great idea. And the contrast of the straight lines of the fance with the curved lines of the hat(?) and trees in the background is a nice touch. It never said anywhere in the challenge that the lines had to be straight ones!', '2009-09-08 01:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639931, 817848, 99346, '<td valign="top">A lovely grainy shot with nice use of sepia. The overexposure in it really brings out and sharpens the lines.</td>', 'A lovely grainy shot with nice use of sepia. The overexposure in it really brings out and sharpens the lines.', '2009-09-08 01:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639956, 817384, 99346, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot. About the only thing I could ask for, is more detail in the water on the right hand side. I can can see there''s a hint of some tree trunks being reflected there, but it still feels a tad empty in that area of the photo. However this is a VERY minor pick with a truely great shot. The mixtures of lines: combining the fishing line with the waterline and also the tree trunks in the background, shows an excellent eye for composition. 9/10</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot. About the only thing I could ask for, is more detail in the water on the right hand side. I can can see there''s a hint of some tree trunks being reflected there, but it still feels a tad empty in that area of the photo. However this is a VERY minor pick with a truely great shot. The mixtures of lines: combining the fishing line with the waterline and also the tree trunks in the background, shows an excellent eye for composition. 9/10', '2009-09-08 02:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639962, 817424, 99346, '<td valign="top">Tasteful vignetting and lovely contrast of the colours at each change in direction of the lines. Great shot composition.</td>', 'Tasteful vignetting and lovely contrast of the colours at each change in direction of the lines. Great shot composition.', '2009-09-08 02:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5639964, 818665, 99346, '<td valign="top">I love the grain in the ground &amp; landscape. Perhaps a touch too much grain for my liking in the clouds and sky, but that''s purely personal preference. This is an excellent photo.</td>', 'I love the grain in the ground & landscape. Perhaps a touch too much grain for my liking in the clouds and sky, but that''s purely personal preference. This is an excellent photo.', '2009-09-08 02:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
