(5640224, 818515, 10785, '<td valign="top">Your take on Personal boundaries meeting the challenge is probably the most creative here. Very nice work. I can sense the anger on the child''s face in the wrinkled lines between the eyes.</td>', 'Your take on Personal boundaries meeting the challenge is probably the most creative here. Very nice work. I can sense the anger on the child''s face in the wrinkled lines between the eyes.', '2009-09-08 09:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
