(5640253, 817920, 10785, '<td valign="top">The texture of the rock is nicely captured. It looks like this was taken under harsh lighting conditions, yet you have a nice exposure. No real blowouts in the highlights and the shadows show up nicely.</td>', 'The texture of the rock is nicely captured. It looks like this was taken under harsh lighting conditions, yet you have a nice exposure. No real blowouts in the highlights and the shadows show up nicely.', '2009-09-08 09:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
