(5641322, 818617, 16106, '<td valign="top">Yah they were mean to you, but they were meaner to the rest. Lovely detail here, any chance of posting your post processing details, you really made this shot ring with the way you brought out the details without any halos.</td>', 'Yah they were mean to you, but they were meaner to the rest. Lovely detail here, any chance of posting your post processing details, you really made this shot ring with the way you brought out the details without any halos.', '2009-09-09 01:49:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641323, 818309, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised it placed so low in the pack. Perhaps a bit too abstract for mass appeal? I gave it an 8 and I see the commenters average was quite high. I would call this a successful entry that hit it''s target audience.</td>', 'I''m surprised it placed so low in the pack. Perhaps a bit too abstract for mass appeal? I gave it an 8 and I see the commenters average was quite high. I would call this a successful entry that hit it''s target audience.', '2009-09-09 01:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641329, 818820, 83313, '<td valign="top">Another placement where I disagreed with the mass appeal. I really like these shots that I call "semi-abstract". You can easily identify what they are, but they concentrate the viewer on the shapes, colors, and details, rather than the object as a whole. I gave this a 7.<br/> <br/>Perhaps some selective noise reduction could have helped with smoothing out that sky a bit. The S5 has a lot of great features, but it isn''t the most silky smooth camera out there.</td>', 'Another placement where I disagreed with the mass appeal. I really like these shots that I call "semi-abstract". You can easily identify what they are, but they concentrate the viewer on the shapes, colors, and details, rather than the object as a whole. I gave this a 7. Perhaps some selective noise reduction could have helped with smoothing out that sky a bit. The S5 has a lot of great features, but it isn''t the most silky smooth camera out there.', '2009-09-09 01:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641335, 818787, 83313, '<td valign="top">People seeing it as DNMC was the only reason it scored so low. Even if you shot this specifically for the challenge, voters will perceive something like this as a shoehorn of the cute shot that you want to show off. It got a 7 from me, and I also recognized your kid as soon as she came up on the screen. What a little cutie!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-09 01:03:38.</i></td>', 'People seeing it as DNMC was the only reason it scored so low. Even if you shot this specifically for the challenge, voters will perceive something like this as a shoehorn of the cute shot that you want to show off. It got a 7 from me, and I also recognized your kid as soon as she came up on the screen. What a little cutie!', '2009-09-09 02:02:09.000000', '2009-09-09 02:03:38.000000', 0),
(5641337, 818778, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty clean image.  I really liked it, clean lines, building texture, and no detractors.</td>', 'This is a pretty clean image.  I really liked it, clean lines, building texture, and no detractors.', '2009-09-09 02:05:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641343, 817821, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lutchenko:</b></div><hr/><i> Now I bet I see this next week taking children to school lol </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I wonder how much expense that will be in yellow paint? (The thought also occurred to me.)</td>', 'Originally posted by Lutchenko: Now I bet I see this next week taking children to school lol  I wonder how much expense that will be in yellow paint? (The thought also occurred to me.)', '2009-09-09 02:09:19.000000', NULL, 0),
