(5641351, 818022, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and moving. Should have scored much, much higher. Good for the Posthumous yellow.</td>', 'This is beautiful and moving. Should have scored much, much higher. Good for the Posthumous yellow.', '2009-09-09 02:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641356, 818820, 61084, '<td valign="top">Thanks for you vote Yo Spiff. For some reason I didn''t realise the noise in the sky until I had already submitted it and went back to look at it. Too late for DPC, but I did fix the sky when I uploaded this to my Flickr account. Looks better. Oh well...I will keep plugging away.</td>', 'Thanks for you vote Yo Spiff. For some reason I didn''t realise the noise in the sky until I had already submitted it and went back to look at it. Too late for DPC, but I did fix the sky when I uploaded this to my Flickr account. Looks better. Oh well...I will keep plugging away.', '2009-09-09 02:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641358, 818617, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, nothing like seeing the photographer''s comment on the blue basically be "voters suck."<br/> <br/>Since you seem to know your shots deserve to win ribbons, why do you bother giving voters the chance to express an opinion?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-09 01:29:04.</i></td>', 'Ah, nothing like seeing the photographer''s comment on the blue basically be "voters suck." Since you seem to know your shots deserve to win ribbons, why do you bother giving voters the chance to express an opinion?', '2009-09-09 02:26:43.000000', '2009-09-09 02:29:04.000000', 0),
