(5641364, 818778, 63218, '<td valign="top">Mostly 5''s &amp; 6''s as you thought. Nice clouds in the 1st shot. Keep an eye on that bldg for some dramatic light this winter, though.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-09 01:30:57.</i></td>', 'Mostly 5''s & 6''s as you thought. Nice clouds in the 1st shot. Keep an eye on that bldg for some dramatic light this winter, though.', '2009-09-09 02:30:06.000000', '2009-09-09 02:30:57.000000', 0),
(5641366, 818757, 103032, '<td valign="top">I really liked this, especially since I''m into a farmer''s market vegetable and flower pic phase (from the P&amp;S SC).  Its got great lines of the leaf veins and great color to it.  I thought it would''ve made it into the 5''s at least.  I don''t understand the 1''s and 2''s and even 3''s.  Maybe a touch over sharpened? or too bright on the white part of the leaf? for the critical DPCer...</td>', 'I really liked this, especially since I''m into a farmer''s market vegetable and flower pic phase (from the P&S SC).  Its got great lines of the leaf veins and great color to it.  I thought it would''ve made it into the 5''s at least.  I don''t understand the 1''s and 2''s and even 3''s.  Maybe a touch over sharpened? or too bright on the white part of the leaf? for the critical DPCer...', '2009-09-09 02:34:10.000000', NULL, 0),
