(5641655, 818330, 46918, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 5 on this pic. I can''t help it but I have a soft side for railroads. There were a few problems though. The railroad tracks need to be centered. It looks like they are slightly to the left. Another thing is maybee a tighter crop.</td>', 'I gave you a 5 on this pic. I can''t help it but I have a soft side for railroads. There were a few problems though. The railroad tracks need to be centered. It looks like they are slightly to the left. Another thing is maybee a tighter crop.', '2009-09-09 09:25:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641664, 818617, 46918, '<td valign="top">I really liked this during voting. Infact I was one of your "7" votes. Good job on the blue...</td>', 'I really liked this during voting. Infact I was one of your "7" votes. Good job on the blue...', '2009-09-09 09:30:10.000000', NULL, 0),
