(5641674, 818755, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by InnaN:</b></div><hr/><i> Great capture! The background is a bit busy and could use rotating. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree.  Not much I could do in this location though.  I would have tried something different if I was actually trying to take a shot for the challenge.  Just wanted to finally put in a second entry.  <br/> <br/>This one was already cropped and rotated to get rid of some worse distractions.  I had a similar one with much better content, but it was just not near as sharp.  Would have scored much better if the shot was technically as good as this one.</td>', 'Originally posted by InnaN: Great capture! The background is a bit busy and could use rotating.   I agree.  Not much I could do in this location though.  I would have tried something different if I was actually trying to take a shot for the challenge.  Just wanted to finally put in a second entry.   This one was already cropped and rotated to get rid of some worse distractions.  I had a similar one with much better content, but it was just not near as sharp.  Would have scored much better if the shot was technically as good as this one.', '2009-09-09 09:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641718, 817470, 108580, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comment, this challenge was a real wierd one. Very few comments even in the top 20. I was hoping for some more constructive criticism from the regulars but alas. Who voted 10? :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-09 09:15:06.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comment, this challenge was a real wierd one. Very few comments even in the top 20. I was hoping for some more constructive criticism from the regulars but alas. Who voted 10? :)', '2009-09-09 10:09:47.000000', '2009-09-09 10:15:06.000000', 0),
(5641725, 818685, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  The inclusion of the sheet music makes the shot. :~)</td>', 'Really nice.  The inclusion of the sheet music makes the shot. :~)', '2009-09-09 10:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
