(5641741, 818000, 24454, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this!!!  Zebras are so awesome, with such great personalities.  You really captured their playful personable personalities.  Congratulations on 5th place!</td>', 'I LOVE this!!!  Zebras are so awesome, with such great personalities.  You really captured their playful personable personalities.  Congratulations on 5th place!', '2009-09-09 10:23:20.000000', NULL, 0),
