(5642823, 818449, 99981, '<td valign="top">Avg 9.000 dos que comentaram! Bizarro né?<br/>De qualquer forma...I really like the perspective of this great exposure!</td>', 'Avg 9.000 dos que comentaram! Bizarro né?De qualquer forma...I really like the perspective of this great exposure!', '2009-09-10 02:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5642882, 817810, 37252, '<td valign="top">I myself like the barb you chose to put in focus. You got it tack sharp too! The background does not feel too busy at all to me. I like it - other than it seems to have a bit of noise. Sure, nice octagon shaped bokeh is best, but we all work with what we have (lens, equip, etc)<br/> <br/>Personally I feel you deserved a much higher score - a high 5 perhaps</td>', 'I myself like the barb you chose to put in focus. You got it tack sharp too! The background does not feel too busy at all to me. I like it - other than it seems to have a bit of noise. Sure, nice octagon shaped bokeh is best, but we all work with what we have (lens, equip, etc) Personally I feel you deserved a much higher score - a high 5 perhaps', '2009-09-10 03:39:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5642900, 818070, 62357, '<td valign="top">I was away whilst this challenge was in voting, so this is the first time I have seen this image.  I have to say, I am astonished that it scored so low, as I feel it''s a pretty strong image.  I haven''t looked at any of the others in this challenge, but I would really have expected it to be up there in the 6.3-6.5 range.  Would have got a 7 or 8 from me!  So, sorry doesn''t help explain the 2s and 3s but...</td>', 'I was away whilst this challenge was in voting, so this is the first time I have seen this image.  I have to say, I am astonished that it scored so low, as I feel it''s a pretty strong image.  I haven''t looked at any of the others in this challenge, but I would really have expected it to be up there in the 6.3-6.5 range.  Would have got a 7 or 8 from me!  So, sorry doesn''t help explain the 2s and 3s but...', '2009-09-10 04:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5642987, 817470, 99256, '<td valign="top">Hey harvey.  I like this shot.  Probably would have been a little better if the drops were a little bigger in my opinion.  I would love to see the reflections in the drops better.  I didn''t get around to voting this week but would have voted it a 6 or 7 probably.</td>', 'Hey harvey.  I like this shot.  Probably would have been a little better if the drops were a little bigger in my opinion.  I would love to see the reflections in the drops better.  I didn''t get around to voting this week but would have voted it a 6 or 7 probably.', '2009-09-10 08:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
