(5643016, 817241, 109596, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bassbone:</b></div><hr/><i> This shot clearly meets the challenge description, but i think it is missing a main component - a place for the viewer to focus, a subject to draw the eye.  The lines in focus are placed in a static location (centered) and the focus on those lines is not as crisp as it could be. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the feedback, it was a bit of a toss up between a couple of shots, I submitted this one coz I thought it had a more interesting DoF and the shot was straighter. Ah well. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by bassbone: This shot clearly meets the challenge description, but i think it is missing a main component - a place for the viewer to focus, a subject to draw the eye.  The lines in focus are placed in a static location (centered) and the focus on those lines is not as crisp as it could be.   Thanks for the feedback, it was a bit of a toss up between a couple of shots, I submitted this one coz I thought it had a more interesting DoF and the shot was straighter. Ah well. :)', '2009-09-10 09:48:13.000000', NULL, 0),
