(5645123, 818787, 76335, '<td valign="top">I might have thought this a bit of a shoehorn, but wouldn''t have ignored how technically good it was. It''s very well composed also -- obviously not candid, but your subject is relaxed and acting natural and having fun. And she''s cute. Probably a five or six from me if I had voted.</td>', 'I might have thought this a bit of a shoehorn, but wouldn''t have ignored how technically good it was. It''s very well composed also -- obviously not candid, but your subject is relaxed and acting natural and having fun. And she''s cute. Probably a five or six from me if I had voted.', '2009-09-13 01:13:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5645152, 818610, 37845, '<td valign="top">I am surprised by your score... I think this deserves to be well above 6.... I gave it a 9 myself. Never would have thought it was a lampstand... thought it was a macro of a screw or a nail.</td>', 'I am surprised by your score... I think this deserves to be well above 6.... I gave it a 9 myself. Never would have thought it was a lampstand... thought it was a macro of a screw or a nail.', '2009-09-13 02:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5645168, 818816, 96574, '<td valign="top">as whole, the picture is pretty, but i agree that the water dominated too much of the photo and wasn''t strong enough of an element to carry that much real estate in your photo. maybe a balance of 1/3 water, 1/3 buildings, and 1/3 sky? i also didn''t feel the connection to "lines" was strong enough in your photo.<br/> <br/>i gave you a 4</td>', 'as whole, the picture is pretty, but i agree that the water dominated too much of the photo and wasn''t strong enough of an element to carry that much real estate in your photo. maybe a balance of 1/3 water, 1/3 buildings, and 1/3 sky? i also didn''t feel the connection to "lines" was strong enough in your photo. i gave you a 4', '2009-09-13 03:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5645484, 818787, 56797, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in the challenge since I was in it and I never vote in challenges I participate in but I did think it was super cute and original. One thing that would have made it better for me would have been if your title was "Mommy makes me pull my hair". Would have made the I love daddy shirt soooooooo much funnier. Even better if she was sitting in front of a plate of peas or something with mommy pointing as if telling her to eat them. something like that. Just to give the photo a story. Honestly, TONS of my pictures don''t have stories. Just trying to troubleshoot why it scored low. <br/>HTH.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-13 19:32:43.</i></td>', 'I didn''t vote in the challenge since I was in it and I never vote in challenges I participate in but I did think it was super cute and original. One thing that would have made it better for me would have been if your title was "Mommy makes me pull my hair". Would have made the I love daddy shirt soooooooo much funnier. Even better if she was sitting in front of a plate of peas or something with mommy pointing as if telling her to eat them. something like that. Just to give the photo a story. Honestly, TONS of my pictures don''t have stories. Just trying to troubleshoot why it scored low. HTH.', '2009-09-13 17:19:23.000000', '2009-09-13 20:32:43.000000', 0),
